4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"BK8NZlJtgsKnh_L_mTRc6Q","review_id":"24oegjZ_iRuGQOuc3pPTfg","date":"2021-05-05T02:48:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9346306324005127,"text_excerpt":"We wandered a mile from our hotel and found this great spot. Cute outdoor courtyard with fantastic live music. It was a really impressive 7 piece band playing funk and jazz. We ordered drinks and an appetizer. We had the loaded potato skin nachos. They were a little spicier than expected but soooo delicious! Anyways. We definitely recommend the yard on Frenchman for great vibes, nice atmosphere And a snack and drink."},{"business_id":"BK8NZlJtgsKnh_L_mTRc6Q","review_id":"gFr3kdwAWPGtUOBJ7jllhw","date":"2021-05-31T18:35:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9068227410316467,"text_excerpt":"The yard is good. Good bar food. When you enjoying yourself on Frenchman St, consider walking towards Esplanade Avenue. Yard is close to Hotel de la Monnae across from the Mint They have live bands and outdoor dining seating. Great entertainment. We ordered fried chicken tender basket with fries and coleslaw. We really enjoyed our meal. The have a good selection of American food"},{"business_id":"BK8NZlJtgsKnh_L_mTRc6Q","review_id":"xALi0HWHbLjNOBLu2t47Ug","date":"2020-12-31T21:28:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9064188599586487,"text_excerpt":"What a great find!! We were wandering around on a Tuesday night looking for something to entertain us (and something to eat) in a covid-stricken land of closed bars and quiet streets. BUT there was hope when we heard music way at the end of the street. We wandered in to find a CUTE little spot with a live jazz band, who were amazing btw. We ordered 2 po'boys, which were both great and a few drinks. Service was good, and the energy was good. I would love to go back! dairy/egg/nut free: fried chicken po boy (no mayo)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"BK8NZlJtgsKnh_L_mTRc6Q","photo_id":"Nh6tZvdTQyq2VFfDZ0RMUg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Nh6tZvdTQyq2VFfDZ0RMUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8978037238121033},{"business_id":"BK8NZlJtgsKnh_L_mTRc6Q","photo_id":"8j7CGRxgdvUPkDizdlmVHQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8j7CGRxgdvUPkDizdlmVHQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.827569305896759},{"business_id":"BK8NZlJtgsKnh_L_mTRc6Q","photo_id":"_IOFykVG_67glcsXbKDPJg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_IOFykVG_67glcsXbKDPJg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.814483642578125}]},"notebook_case":null}
